//　その原点――
//　己が選んだ道を思い出す。
  If I am the root of Sorimachi's deeds, then this is the root of mine.

  <I>To kill for peace.</I>㉑ This is the road I have walked. Will I abandon it now?

  Who will it save to kill this man? It will save no one. Bring peace to no one.

  No one. Only me.


//　<RUBY text='・・・・・・・・・・・'>人を殺して平和を求める</RUBY>。
//　そんな道に、俺は立っていたのだ。

